<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-108" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">雍州刺史<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession:m0004" ref="qad_k9o_71k">朱序</persName>以老病求解職，詔以太子右衛率<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession:m0020" ref="ebb_5a7_96e">郗恢</persName>為雍州刺史，代<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession:m0029" ref="qad_k9o_71k">序</persName>鎮襄陽。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession:m0034" ref="ebb_5a7_96e">恢</persName>，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:succession:m0036" ref="e5k_f2i_cog">曇</persName>之子也。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:seal" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">西燕主<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:seal:m0003" ref="gyg_hql_qdj">永</persName>困急，遣其子常山公<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:seal:m0013" ref="gyg_hql_qdj_A">弘</persName>等求救於雍州刺史<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-108-jin067-xitan-xihui:seal:m0022" ref="ebb_5a7_96e">郗恢</persName>，並獻玉璽一紐。</p>
</text>
